OL,3,AUS tech stocks see sharp falls over AI
OL,4,Acost fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS stocks have continued to slide as
OL,7,Fconcerns continue to intensify over the
OL,8,Fincreasing costs of the artificial
OL,9,Fintelligence (AI) build out.
OL,11,FShares in Intel continued their
OL,12,Fovernight slide into early trading on
OL,13,FFriday, falling as much as 30% after
OL,14,Fthe chip maker warned of a weaker
OL,15,Fcomputer market even as it plans to
OL,16,Fincrease spending on AI.
OL,18,FAmazon shares fell as far as 6% before
OL,19,Frecovering after its reported earnings
OL,20,Fon Thursday evening fell short of
OL,21,Finvestors' expectations.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
