OL,3,AUS tech stocks see sharp falls over AI
OL,4,Acost fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tech-heavy Nasdaq stock exchange
OL,7,Fopened on Friday at its lowest level in
OL,8,Fmore than two months, down 2.5%, as
OL,9,Fother tech stocks including Reddit and
OL,10,FRoblox continued to fall.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
