OL,3,ASir Patrick Stewart: Actor who moved
OL,4,Aeffortlessly between Star Trek and
OL,5,AShakespeare
OL,6,
OL,7,FSir Patrick Stewart, who has died at
OL,8,Fthe age of 86, was a stage and screen
OL,9,Fgreat who balanced Hollywood stardom
OL,10,Fwith an equally stellar career in
OL,11,Fclassical theatre.
OL,13,FWhile many actors are typecast, he
OL,14,Fmoved effortlessly from Shakespeare and
OL,15,FDickens to the command of the USS
OL,16,FEnterprise and his famous wheelchair in
OL,17,FX-Men.
OL,19,FIn a career that spanned seven decades,
OL,20,FSir Patrick received multiple awards, a
OL,21,Fstar on the Hollywood Walk of Fame and
OL,22,Fa knighthood from Queen Elizabeth II.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
